{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16130","headline":"上李吉甫相公 · 王建","name":"上李吉甫相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣朝齐贺说逢殷，霄汉无云日月真。\n金鼎调和天膳美，瑶池沐浴赐衣新。\n两河开地山川正，四海休兵造化仁。\n曾向山东爲散吏，当今窦宪是贤臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}